Tunnel is an independent project and is not endorsed by Cloudflare, OpenAI,
Anthropic or Vercel. Their product names identify integration targets.

cloudflared is downloaded separately from official Cloudflare releases; no
cloudflared binary is included in this source package. Its license and notices
are maintained at https://github.com/cloudflare/cloudflared . Review those
terms and Cloudflare service terms before using the provider.

The JavaScript core uses Node.js standard-library modules and has no bundled
third-party npm dependencies. Development/installation tools are separate.
